WEBVTT

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.790
<i>I'm not good with guys.</i>

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.670
<i>Even more so since entering middle school.</i>

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.020
<i>They're so violent, and noisy, and crude.</i>

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:34.510
<i>But...</i>

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:40.800
<i>Tanaka, from the class next door, seems different than the rest.</i>

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.460
<i>He's...</i>

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:50.650
<i>short and has a high-pitched voice.</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.280
<i>Just like a girl.</i>

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.350
<i>His voice is soft and refined.</i>

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.510
<i>Maybe that's why...</i>

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.980
<i>I'm fine around him.</i>

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:30.470
Rock-paper-scissors! Rock-paper-scissors!

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.890
Hey, Naitou!

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.010
What're you doing?

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:40.240
We're choosing teams for cops and robbers.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:41.280
Cops and robbers?

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.420
You're like elementary schoolers!

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:46.080
I know, right?

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.850
I wanna play too!

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.710
Futaba, you guys come join us!

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:52.430
Okay?

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:55.700
What? Cops and robbers?

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:56.040
What, we're gonna play with girls?

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.590
Come on!

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:58.430
What, we're gonna play with girls?

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.940
What should we do, Futaba?

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:14.740
I guess we could play.

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.500
Okay! Then it's settled!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.310
Take it away, Naitou!

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.700
Sure thing!

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:24.130
Rock-paper-scissors! Rock-paper-scissors!

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:25.160
Shoot!

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.670
Okay, robbers, stage your escape.

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:29.620
I'll count to a hundred!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:40.860
One... two... three... four... five... six... seven... eight... nine...

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.460
<i>When was the last time I played cops and robbers?</i>

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:44.060
One... two... three... four... five... six... seven... eight... nine...

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:50.860
I guess I'll hide here for now.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:04.470
Sorry. I'll go somewhere else.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:11.470
Too late.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:14.380
The cops are coming.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.280
You're right. Thanks.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:36.520
<i>He's surprisingly strong.</i>

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:40.490
<i>The bones in his arm stick out.</i>

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:48.730
<i>The nape of his neck is concealed. It's cute.</i>

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:50.520
Whoa!

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.560
That was close.

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.020
They almost found us.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.790
<i>He smelled like shampoo...</i>

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.790
<i>with a hint of sweat.</i>

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:10.560
<i>I wonder if this is what boys smell like.</i>

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:17.570
<i>Wha—</i>

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:23.840
<i>What do I do?!</i>

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:27.680
<i>If Tanaka is a telepath and was reading my mind just then...</i>

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.080
<i>I'm sorry! I'll stop thinking about weird stuff!</i>

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.080
<b>Insurance in case he
really is a telepath</b>

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.210
<i>Abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz.</i>

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.800
Don't you think someone might be over there?

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.670
Yeah, I'll go check it out.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.290
You stay here, Yoshioka.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:45.550
I knew it!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.470
Get him!

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:47.760
Don't let him get away!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:48.910
Surround him!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.720
Let's catch him!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.270
You aren't getting through.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:54.890
Tag!

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:57.100
We did it!

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:59.070
<i>He got caught</i>

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.400
<i>because of me.</i>

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:12.310
<i>If I tag a captured robber, they can break out.</i>

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.460
<i>Okay!</i>

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:15.870
<i>I gotta save him!</i>

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:19.250
<i>Wait for me, Tanaka!</i>

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.800
<i>I'll get you soon!</i>

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.200
I was trying to save you.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.200
Yeah...

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.790
<i>What do you talk about in these kinda situations?</i>

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.580
<i>Wonder if he'll say something to me.</i>

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:58.740
Uh...

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.550
Thanks.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:03.580
Yeah.

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:10.760
<i>The nape of his neck really </i>is<i> cute.</i>

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:18.130
When I saw you running to me...

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:22.940
it made me... really happy.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.250
Y-Yeah.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.660
<i>Oh no, my voice trembled.</i>

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.170
Yeah.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:36.080
<i>He's not like the other boys.</i>

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.520
<i>I'm totally fine with him.</i>

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:40.170
<i>He's not unpleasant.</i>

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:41.750
Yeah.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.870
I'll take a cream-filled bun, a cutlet sandwich,
and curry bread, please!

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.110
I want a noodle roll and a chocolate muffin!

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:56.360
It's really busy today.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:59.350
Seems like a lot of people didn't bring their own lunch.

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.170
You think they have any croquette bread left?

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.820
Dunno. Maybe.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.090
What's our next class again?

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.480
Math?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:48.080
When is math ever gonna be useful to us?

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.690
Seriously.

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:54.000
I told you, don't touch my hair!

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:17.890
When it comes to conjunctions
you have "and," "for," and "but."

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.580
<i>Nowadays, it's always like that.</i>

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:22.870
<i>When our eyes met,</i>

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.190
<i>we'd always look away once.</i>

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.890
<i>Then we'd make eye contact again.</i>

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:40.280
I, for one, like English, but I don't like exams.

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:41.100
For this...

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.070
<i>It's not a coincidence, right?</i>

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.940
Here I go!

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:58.110
Okay!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.440
Watermelon? I want some!

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.310
Over here!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.450
Take that!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:06.680
That was a bit much.

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:07.980
My bad.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:30.160
Crazy weather, huh?

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:32.640
Yeah.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.320
<i>Whoops, I messed up!</i>

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:38.860
<i>I should've responded with something better than "yeah."</i>

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.070
<i>I don't dislike him.</i>

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.090
<i>But he still kinda makes me nervous.</i>

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.810
<i>Why?</i>

00:10:57.810 --> 00:11:01.700
<i>It's almost as if I like...</i>

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.080
<i>What? No way.</i>

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:04.140
<i>Do I?</i>

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.430
<i>As if!</i>

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.410
<i>This is getting embarrassing!</i>

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.200
<i>I gotta say something!</i>

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:14.770
<b>Festival
Sakisaka Shrine</b>

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:17.570
Tanaka! Are you going to the festival?

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.260
What?

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:23.310
<i>Did the way I put that make it sound like an invitation?</i>

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:26.640
<i>If he took it that way, it'd be super embarrassing.</i>

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.180
I don't know if Yumi's going.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:31.500
I was wondering if I should ask her.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:37.030
Here. Use this.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:39.710
You'll catch a cold.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:42.680
Use it to dry yourself.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:46.200
Gym clothes?

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.630
It's okay.

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:49.350
I haven't worn it.

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:51.710
Except once.

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:54.370
What?! So you <i>have</i> worn it?!

00:11:58.660 --> 00:11:59.840
<i>That was a very...</i>

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.600
<i>very mischievous laugh.</i>

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:08.420
Fine, then! I <i>will</i> use it!

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:10.730
All right.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.620
Thanks.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:14.950
<i>I wonder what kind of face</i>

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.220
<i>he's making right now.</i>

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:28.010
<i>Does he also...</i>

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.870
<i>Maybe?</i>

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:33.520
<i>Or maybe not?</i>

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.610
<b>Class 1-3</b>

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.450
Here, your gym clothes.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:38.410
Thank you.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:39.850
Yeah.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:44.850
Bye.

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.450
Are you going to the festival?

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:49.350
Huh?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.210
Did you make plans with your friend?

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:54.920
Not yet.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:56.850
7 o'clock!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:03.660
At the clock in Triangle Park.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.960
<i>Huh? What's this?</i>

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:14.520
<i>Is he asking to go together?</i>

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:16.710
<i>Is that what that was?</i>

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.230
<i>Maybe it wasn't.</i>

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.250
Um, just now...

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.420
What're you two doing?

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:28.910
She was just returning something I lent her.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.820
Oh, that so?

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:32.370
Lame.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.630
<i>Did we just make plans?</i>

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:36.450
<i>Or what?</i>

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:42.130
You're telling me there's nothing between you two?

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:44.800
Spill the beans! C'mon!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.800
<i>I really do hate guys.</i>

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.400
C'mon!

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:51.810
<i>Tanaka is the only exception.</i>

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.960
C'mon, tell me!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.580
<i>Only Tanaka.</i>

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.020
Hey, I asked you a question!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.230
<i>I hate the rest.</i>

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:01.480
Shut up already!

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.090
This is why I hate guys!

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:06.300
You're all idiots!

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:09.280
I hate all guys!

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.000
What was that?

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:16.200
<i>Did he hear what I just said?</i>

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:17.880
Let's get going.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.330
R-Right.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:30.220
<i>But he understands that he's different, right?</i>

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.710
<i>It'll be okay, right?</i>

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:36.050
<i>I mean...</i>

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:42.870
<i>Our eyes have met so many times.</i>

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.780
7 o'clock.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:59.270
At the clock in Triangle Park.

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:05.850
<i>It's fine.</i>

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:07.600
<i>He understands.</i>

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:15.080
<i>That I think that he's different than other guys.</i>

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:21.150
<i>I'm sure he understands.</i>

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:23.250
<i>It's obvious, right?</i>

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.330
<i>It goes without saying.</i>

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.440
C'mon, let's go!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.980
You're going too fast!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.050
<i>I'm sure it'll be fine.</i>

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.510
I should've asked for his phone number.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:08.080
<i>Maybe I misheard him.</i>

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:11.340
<i>Maybe he meant 8 o'clock or something.</i>

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.160
<i>I guess he really did get the wrong idea.</i>

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:27.630
You're all idiots!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.380
I hate all guys!

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:33.910
<i>Maybe he hates me now.</i>

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:38.970
<i>I mean, it's not like he explicitly invited me.</i>

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:40.640
<i>7 o'clock.</i>

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.880
<i>At the clock in Triangle Park.</i>

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:51.140
<i>That wasn't really a promise.</i>

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:55.280
<i>But then...</i>

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.260
<i>What exactly was it?</i>

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:07.960
Futaba!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.090
Over here!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:09.350
<i>Hey, Tanaka.</i>

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:11.000
Hurry!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:11.520
<i>Hey, Tanaka.</i>

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:14.970
<i>What did you mean when you said that?</i>

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:17.150
<i>I want to find out.</i>

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.440
<i>Let's talk about it.</i>

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:25.850
What's up, Yumi?

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:26.780
Huh?

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.590
Fireworks?

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:30.760
Huh? Hmm...

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:33.320
Sure. That sounds fine.

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.940
Oh, it's nothing.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.670
Yeah. Yeah.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.210
See ya.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:53.350
I wish summer vacation would hurry up and end.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:02.240
Wow, you're so tan!

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:03.430
So are you!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:07.240
I burned quite a bit! It hurt!

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:08.290
Bye!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.640
Let's go, Futaba!

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.290
Oh, sure.

00:18:14.020 --> 00:18:16.570
Huh? Tanaka changed schools?

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.980
I heard he moved over summer break.

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.280
He didn't tell me anything!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.380
Huh? Not even you, Naitou?

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:24.370
Nobody knows how to get in touch.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.560
Seriously?

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:26.940
Think something happened?

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:28.750
I wonder if anyone knows.

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:33.430
<i>When the second trimester started, Tanaka wasn't there.</i>

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:40.710
Bye, Futaba!

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:41.820
See you tomorrow!

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:43.680
Bye bye!

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:04.370
Again...

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:15.920
<i>There's no way he'd be there.</i>

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.640
<i>Crazy weather, huh?</i>

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:28.910
Yeah.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.390
No, that's not right!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.070
<i>Next time, I'll have a way better response prepared.</i>

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.590
Next time...

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.570
When will the next time be?

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:01.470
I really want to see him...

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.270
<i>Will we never see each other again?</i>

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:17.190
<i>I like you, Tanaka.</i>

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:20.070
<i>It was vague.</i>

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.240
<i>And I was fumbling through it.</i>

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.660
<i>But I liked him.</i>

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:35.290
<i>But...</i>

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:39.010
<i>Nothing came of it.</i>

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:40.870
<i>Nothing at all.</i>

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:45.510
<i>Tanaka.</i>

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:51.400
<i>What kind of face are you making right now?</i>
